{"id": "wwdc2017-719", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2017/719", "wordCount": 3788, "segments": [{"start": 18.0, "text": "Hello and welcome to the"}, {"start": 19.0, "text": "Enabling Your App for CarPlay"}, {"start": 20.0, "text": "session."}, {"start": 21.0, "text": "My name is Albert and I'm an"}, {"start": 22.0, "text": "engineer on the CarPlay team."}, {"start": 25.0, "text": "Today we'll be going through an"}, {"start": 26.0, "text": "overview of how apps behave in"}, {"start": 27.0, "text": "CarPlay, how to get your app"}, {"start": 29.0, "text": "integrated on the CarPlay"}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "platform and best practices and"}, {"start": 32.0, "text": "pitfalls to avoid."}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "Let's look at how apps run in"}, {"start": 36.0, "text": "CarPlay."}, {"start": 37.0, "text": "When CarPlay is active some"}, {"start": 39.0, "text": "information will be available"}, {"start": 41.0, "text": "and accessible from the CarPlay"}, {"start": 42.0, "text": "screen."}, {"start": 43.0, "text": "If an app has posted now playing"}, {"start": 44.0, "text": "metadata and playback controls"}, {"start": 46.0, "text": "for audio content this"}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "information will also be"}, {"start": 49.0, "text": "accessible from the Now Playing"}, {"start": 50.0, "text": "app on the CarPlay Home screen."}, {"start": 53.0, "text": "Audio will be played through a"}, {"start": 54.0, "text": "car speaker system and some"}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "SiriKit intents will be"}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "supported in CarPlay."}, {"start": 60.0, "text": "If we user triggers of SiriKit"}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "intent that is not supported"}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "while in CarPlay Siri will"}, {"start": 64.0, "text": "notify the user that it is not"}, {"start": 66.0, "text": "available in the car."}, {"start": 69.0, "text": "Even though your app may not"}, {"start": 71.0, "text": "support CarPlay users may use"}, {"start": 73.0, "text": "your app while in CarPlay before"}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "they begin driving."}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "To ensure a great user"}, {"start": 77.0, "text": "experience for all apps in"}, {"start": 79.0, "text": "CarPlay make sure that your app"}, {"start": 81.0, "text": "doesn't play audio unless"}, {"start": 82.0, "text": "requested since your app could"}, {"start": 84.0, "text": "override currently playing audio"}, {"start": 86.0, "text": "the user intended to play."}, {"start": 89.0, "text": "In some instances, your app will"}, {"start": 91.0, "text": "want to interact with other"}, {"start": 92.0, "text": "audio streams appropriately."}, {"start": 94.0, "text": "For spoken audio apps such as"}, {"start": 96.0, "text": "Audiobooks use this protocol so"}, {"start": 98.0, "text": "your audio will pause when other"}, {"start": 100.0, "text": "audio streams are active."}, {"start": 102.0, "text": "For navigation apps where"}, {"start": 103.0, "text": "guidance instructions are given"}, {"start": 104.0, "text": "intermittently use these two"}, {"start": 107.0, "text": "protocols, the latter of which"}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "will pause audio streams marked"}, {"start": 110.0, "text": "as spoken audio before"}, {"start": 111.0, "text": "initiating your audio session."}, {"start": 113.0, "text": "Because guidance voices will mix"}, {"start": 116.0, "text": "with other audio streams set"}, {"start": 118.0, "text": "your audio session to mixable so"}, {"start": 119.0, "text": "that it can interact with other"}, {"start": 121.0, "text": "audio streams."}, {"start": 122.0, "text": "For apps that have deeper"}, {"start": 125.0, "text": "CarPlay integration the app icon"}, {"start": 127.0, "text": "will appear on the CarPlay Home"}, {"start": 129.0, "text": "screen."}, {"start": 130.0, "text": "Apps that are launched in"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "CarPlay will launch in the"}, {"start": 132.0, "text": "foreground on both the CarPlay"}, {"start": 134.0, "text": "and iPhone screen."}, {"start": 136.0, "text": "For apps that are not integrated"}, {"start": 137.0, "text": "with CarPlay only the iPhone"}, {"start": 139.0, "text": "screen will have the app in the"}, {"start": 140.0, "text": "foreground and CarPlay will only"}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "display the Home screen."}, {"start": 144.0, "text": "There are certain categories of"}, {"start": 147.0, "text": "apps that can support deeper"}, {"start": 148.0, "text": "CarPlay integration."}, {"start": 150.0, "text": "These are audio apps, messaging"}, {"start": 152.0, "text": "and VoIP apps and automaker"}, {"start": 154.0, "text": "apps."}, {"start": 155.0, "text": "Audio apps deliver music, news,"}, {"start": 157.0, "text": "podcasts and other audio content"}, {"start": 159.0, "text": "using a consistent design that's"}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "optimized for use in the car."}, {"start": 164.0, "text": "Messaging and VoIP apps work"}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "using Siri and can be updated to"}, {"start": 167.0, "text": "appear in CarPlay."}, {"start": 169.0, "text": "Automaker apps provide vehicle"}, {"start": 171.0, "text": "specific controls and displays"}, {"start": 173.0, "text": "to keep drivers connected"}, {"start": 174.0, "text": "without leaving CarPlay."}, {"start": 177.0, "text": "If you think your audio,"}, {"start": 178.0, "text": "automaker, messaging or VoIP"}, {"start": 180.0, "text": "calling app has the potential to"}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "be supported by CarPlay tell us"}, {"start": 184.0, "text": "about it at the CarPlay"}, {"start": 185.0, "text": "developer portal."}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "There you'll be able to request"}, {"start": 188.0, "text": "an entitlement to get your app"}, {"start": 189.0, "text": "running in CarPlay."}, {"start": 190.0, "text": "Keep in mind that certain assets"}, {"start": 194.0, "text": "and images will need to have"}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "CarPlay specific assets and to"}, {"start": 197.0, "text": "provide 2X and 3X sized images"}, {"start": 200.0, "text": "since the CarPlay screen has"}, {"start": 201.0, "text": "varying resolutions and sizes"}, {"start": 203.0, "text": "depending on a vehicle's"}, {"start": 204.0, "text": "display."}, {"start": 206.0, "text": "For more guidance on icons and"}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "designing your app for CarPlay"}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "check out the iOS Human"}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "Interface Guidelines and the"}, {"start": 212.0, "text": "CarPlay Human Interface"}, {"start": 213.0, "text": "Guidelines."}, {"start": 216.0, "text": "While you can test the CarPlay"}, {"start": 217.0, "text": "app on iOS simulator in Xcode it"}, {"start": 220.0, "text": "is best to test on an actual"}, {"start": 221.0, "text": "device connected to a real"}, {"start": 222.0, "text": "vehicle head unit for realistic"}, {"start": 224.0, "text": "results."}, {"start": 226.0, "text": "For apps that will play audio"}, {"start": 227.0, "text": "the simulator has some"}, {"start": 228.0, "text": "limitations on playback state"}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "which does not reflect on what a"}, {"start": 232.0, "text": "user will actually experience."}, {"start": 234.0, "text": "To fully debug your app with"}, {"start": 235.0, "text": "LLDB support Xcode now supports"}, {"start": 238.0, "text": "wireless debugging so that an"}, {"start": 240.0, "text": "iPhone can be connected to a"}, {"start": 241.0, "text": "vehicle or aftermarket head unit"}, {"start": 243.0, "text": "while debugging your app."}, {"start": 245.0, "text": "For more information, please see"}, {"start": 246.0, "text": "the debugging with Xcode 9"}, {"start": 248.0, "text": "session which will be available"}, {"start": 249.0, "text": "this week in WWDC."}, {"start": 251.0, "text": "If your app uses data protection"}, {"start": 254.0, "text": "for user data or content keep in"}, {"start": 257.0, "text": "mind that apps in CarPlay will"}, {"start": 258.0, "text": "likely run while the iPhone is"}, {"start": 260.0, "text": "pass code locked."}, {"start": 261.0, "text": "If your app has pass code"}, {"start": 262.0, "text": "protected data using the"}, {"start": 264.0, "text": "following types for files,"}, {"start": 266.0, "text": "keychains or SQL like databases"}, {"start": 269.0, "text": "shown here your data may be"}, {"start": 271.0, "text": "unavailable while in CarPlay and"}, {"start": 273.0, "text": "your app may behave"}, {"start": 274.0, "text": "unexpectedly."}, {"start": 275.0, "text": "Let's take a closer look at"}, {"start": 278.0, "text": "getting your app integrated with"}, {"start": 279.0, "text": "CarPlay."}, {"start": 280.0, "text": "We will highlight the three"}, {"start": 282.0, "text": "categories of apps that support"}, {"start": 284.0, "text": "CarPlay integration, audio apps,"}, {"start": 286.0, "text": "messaging and VoIP apps, and"}, {"start": 288.0, "text": "automaker apps."}, {"start": 289.0, "text": "Let's get started with audio"}, {"start": 292.0, "text": "apps."}, {"start": 294.0, "text": "Audio apps in CarPlay present"}, {"start": 295.0, "text": "content in an interface that's"}, {"start": 297.0, "text": "optimized for the platform"}, {"start": 299.0, "text": "providing the user an easily"}, {"start": 300.0, "text": "navigable way to access their"}, {"start": 302.0, "text": "content."}, {"start": 303.0, "text": "Audio app developers provide a"}, {"start": 304.0, "text": "data source, as well as a"}, {"start": 306.0, "text": "navigation hierarchy for the"}, {"start": 307.0, "text": "CarPlay platform to render"}, {"start": 309.0, "text": "onscreen."}, {"start": 310.0, "text": "In addition, now playing"}, {"start": 313.0, "text": "information will be presented"}, {"start": 314.0, "text": "providing the user with relevant"}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "metadata, as well as adjustable"}, {"start": 317.0, "text": "commands for the user to handle"}, {"start": 319.0, "text": "playback speeds, tracks and"}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "other actions audio apps may"}, {"start": 322.0, "text": "support."}, {"start": 325.0, "text": "After receiving the app"}, {"start": 326.0, "text": "entitlement audio apps in"}, {"start": 327.0, "text": "CarPlay must at a minimum"}, {"start": 329.0, "text": "implement the MP playable"}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "content APIs, which include the"}, {"start": 332.0, "text": "data source and delegate in"}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "order for CarPlay to fetch"}, {"start": 335.0, "text": "content items and initialize"}, {"start": 336.0, "text": "playback."}, {"start": 338.0, "text": "Audio apps must also respond to"}, {"start": 340.0, "text": "MPRemoteCommandCenter events"}, {"start": 342.0, "text": "which let the user perform"}, {"start": 343.0, "text": "commands on your content, such"}, {"start": 345.0, "text": "as play, pause or skip tracks."}, {"start": 348.0, "text": "Finally, audio apps must set and"}, {"start": 350.0, "text": "update the"}, {"start": 351.0, "text": "MPNowPlayingInfoCenter"}, {"start": 352.0, "text": "dictionary which contain"}, {"start": 354.0, "text": "metadata on the item that is"}, {"start": 355.0, "text": "currently playing, such as item"}, {"start": 357.0, "text": "title, artist name or duration"}, {"start": 359.0, "text": "time."}, {"start": 360.0, "text": "Let's take a closer look at how"}, {"start": 362.0, "text": "data is structured for audio"}, {"start": 364.0, "text": "apps."}, {"start": 365.0, "text": "CarPlay will ask for content"}, {"start": 366.0, "text": "items at a specific index path"}, {"start": 368.0, "text": "using an NSIndexPath."}, {"start": 370.0, "text": "And this is different than how"}, {"start": 371.0, "text": "NSIndexPath objects are used in"}, {"start": 373.0, "text": "UITableView."}, {"start": 375.0, "text": "Let's go through an example"}, {"start": 376.0, "text": "shown here where the left most"}, {"start": 377.0, "text": "content items are the root items"}, {"start": 379.0, "text": "and can be represented in the"}, {"start": 380.0, "text": "user interface as individual"}, {"start": 382.0, "text": "tabs or a root table view."}, {"start": 384.0, "text": "Here's the index paths for each"}, {"start": 387.0, "text": "content item represented in the"}, {"start": 389.0, "text": "hierarchy."}, {"start": 390.0, "text": "When CarPlay asks for a content"}, {"start": 392.0, "text": "item for a particular index path"}, {"start": 394.0, "text": "we, the audio app, would"}, {"start": 395.0, "text": "traverse the hierarchy for the"}, {"start": 396.0, "text": "requested content item."}, {"start": 398.0, "text": "In this example, we are asking"}, {"start": 400.0, "text": "for the first child of the first"}, {"start": 402.0, "text": "content which is the running"}, {"start": 404.0, "text": "playlist content item."}, {"start": 407.0, "text": "CarPlay will also ask for the"}, {"start": 409.0, "text": "number of child items of a"}, {"start": 410.0, "text": "particular index."}, {"start": 412.0, "text": "In this example, we are asking"}, {"start": 413.0, "text": "for the number of child items"}, {"start": 415.0, "text": "for the third child item of the"}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "second route content item."}, {"start": 419.0, "text": "In this example, we will return"}, {"start": 421.0, "text": "two."}, {"start": 424.0, "text": "Some vehicles may enforce"}, {"start": 425.0, "text": "limited content to show onscreen"}, {"start": 427.0, "text": "depending on whether the vehicle"}, {"start": 428.0, "text": "is in motion."}, {"start": 429.0, "text": "This can limit the number of"}, {"start": 431.0, "text": "rows shown onscreen, as well as"}, {"start": 433.0, "text": "container depth when drilling"}, {"start": 434.0, "text": "into content."}, {"start": 436.0, "text": "Your app can take these changes"}, {"start": 437.0, "text": "into account using MP Playable"}, {"start": 439.0, "text": "Content Manager."}, {"start": 440.0, "text": "To check if content limits are"}, {"start": 443.0, "text": "enforced implement the Delegate"}, {"start": 444.0, "text": "Callback Content Manager Did"}, {"start": 446.0, "text": "Update and check if the content"}, {"start": 448.0, "text": "limits are enforced."}, {"start": 450.0, "text": "From there your app can check"}, {"start": 451.0, "text": "the context properties to"}, {"start": 453.0, "text": "determine how many items are"}, {"start": 454.0, "text": "permitted in the table view and"}, {"start": 456.0, "text": "the maximum depth in the"}, {"start": 457.0, "text": "hierarchy your app is permitted"}, {"start": 459.0, "text": "to show."}, {"start": 460.0, "text": "If your app benefits from"}, {"start": 462.0, "text": "displaying data using tabs"}, {"start": 464.0, "text": "rather than exclusively table"}, {"start": 465.0, "text": "views you can add tabs by adding"}, {"start": 468.0, "text": "UI browsable content support"}, {"start": 469.0, "text": "section browsing in your app's"}, {"start": 471.0, "text": "info.plist file."}, {"start": 473.0, "text": "We recommend having at most four"}, {"start": 475.0, "text": "tabs with short titles due to"}, {"start": 477.0, "text": "space constraints and for"}, {"start": 478.0, "text": "vehicles that have a narrow"}, {"start": 479.0, "text": "screen size, as well as"}, {"start": 481.0, "text": "accounting for the Now Playing"}, {"start": 482.0, "text": "button shown while content is"}, {"start": 484.0, "text": "playing."}, {"start": 485.0, "text": "Tab image assets will be"}, {"start": 486.0, "text": "rendered as template images on"}, {"start": 488.0, "text": "the CarPlay screen."}, {"start": 489.0, "text": "Now let's talk about the Now"}, {"start": 492.0, "text": "Playing screen in CarPlay."}, {"start": 493.0, "text": "Some controls and metadata here"}, {"start": 495.0, "text": "are identical to what is shown"}, {"start": 496.0, "text": "in Control Center."}, {"start": 498.0, "text": "In general, what controls and"}, {"start": 500.0, "text": "data you see in Control Center"}, {"start": 501.0, "text": "should also be presented here in"}, {"start": 503.0, "text": "the CarPlay Now Playing screen."}, {"start": 505.0, "text": "This Now Playing screen can be"}, {"start": 507.0, "text": "accessed either by the user"}, {"start": 508.0, "text": "tapping Now Playing on the top"}, {"start": 510.0, "text": "right of your app's navigation"}, {"start": 511.0, "text": "interface or through the Now"}, {"start": 513.0, "text": "Playing app on the CarPlay Home"}, {"start": 514.0, "text": "screen."}, {"start": 516.0, "text": "Your app's name will appear on"}, {"start": 517.0, "text": "the top right of the Now Playing"}, {"start": 518.0, "text": "screen when it is active."}, {"start": 522.0, "text": "Setting metadata for CarPlay's"}, {"start": 524.0, "text": "Now Playing screen is the same"}, {"start": 525.0, "text": "as Control Center and other"}, {"start": 526.0, "text": "sources."}, {"start": 527.0, "text": "Set a dictionary of information"}, {"start": 529.0, "text": "to MPNowPlayingInfoCenter and"}, {"start": 531.0, "text": "fill out as much of the entries"}, {"start": 532.0, "text": "as appropriate."}, {"start": 533.0, "text": "In addition, respond to playback"}, {"start": 537.0, "text": "commands so that the user can"}, {"start": 538.0, "text": "choose to adjust content such as"}, {"start": 540.0, "text": "play, pause, skip tracks or"}, {"start": 543.0, "text": "shuffle and repeat of playback"}, {"start": 545.0, "text": "queue."}, {"start": 546.0, "text": "These commands here are the ones"}, {"start": 548.0, "text": "that are supported on the"}, {"start": 549.0, "text": "CarPlay Now Playing screen."}, {"start": 550.0, "text": "New in iOS 11 is the ability to"}, {"start": 554.0, "text": "adjust and display the playback"}, {"start": 555.0, "text": "rate in the Now Playing screen."}, {"start": 557.0, "text": "To display playback rate in your"}, {"start": 559.0, "text": "app's Now Playing screen in"}, {"start": 560.0, "text": "CarPlay add MPNowPlayingInfo"}, {"start": 563.0, "text": "PropertyDefaultPlaybackRate to"}, {"start": 564.0, "text": "MP Now Playing Info Center and"}, {"start": 566.0, "text": "respond to the change playback"}, {"start": 568.0, "text": "rate command with an array of"}, {"start": 569.0, "text": "supported rates in"}, {"start": 570.0, "text": "MPRemoteCommandCenter."}, {"start": 572.0, "text": "Here is an example of how you"}, {"start": 574.0, "text": "would implement playback rate"}, {"start": 576.0, "text": "adjustments and code."}, {"start": 577.0, "text": "In this sample, the default"}, {"start": 578.0, "text": "playback rate of the currently"}, {"start": 580.0, "text": "playing item is 1.0 and the"}, {"start": 582.0, "text": "supported playback rates here"}, {"start": 583.0, "text": "are 0.5, 1.0, 1.5, and 2.0."}, {"start": 588.0, "text": "When the user wants to adjust"}, {"start": 589.0, "text": "the playback speed increment the"}, {"start": 591.0, "text": "playback rate forward cycling"}, {"start": 592.0, "text": "back to the beginning if the"}, {"start": 594.0, "text": "audio is playing at the fastest"}, {"start": 595.0, "text": "supported rate."}, {"start": 597.0, "text": "In this code sample, playback"}, {"start": 598.0, "text": "rate will increment to 1.5 then"}, {"start": 601.0, "text": "2.0 and then back to 0.5."}, {"start": 603.0, "text": "Some audio apps may respond to"}, {"start": 607.0, "text": "multiple commands in MP Remote"}, {"start": 608.0, "text": "Command Center."}, {"start": 610.0, "text": "Depending on what commands are"}, {"start": 611.0, "text": "enabled CarPlay's Now Playing"}, {"start": 612.0, "text": "screen will combine certain"}, {"start": 614.0, "text": "relevant commands into a single"}, {"start": 615.0, "text": "button such as an ellipsis or a"}, {"start": 618.0, "text": "menu button replacing the"}, {"start": 619.0, "text": "previous track button."}, {"start": 620.0, "text": "For best practices, make sure"}, {"start": 625.0, "text": "that content is actually ready"}, {"start": 626.0, "text": "to be played or be displayed"}, {"start": 628.0, "text": "before calling the completion"}, {"start": 629.0, "text": "handlers in MP playable content"}, {"start": 631.0, "text": "data source and MP playable"}, {"start": 632.0, "text": "content delegate."}, {"start": 634.0, "text": "For apps that do not opt into"}, {"start": 635.0, "text": "tabs and only use table views"}, {"start": 637.0, "text": "the root table view must return"}, {"start": 639.0, "text": "at least one item."}, {"start": 640.0, "text": "CarPlay would show a loading"}, {"start": 642.0, "text": "activity indicator and will time"}, {"start": 644.0, "text": "out after period of time if an"}, {"start": 645.0, "text": "app has not responded with"}, {"start": 646.0, "text": "content."}, {"start": 647.0, "text": "If your app has some initial"}, {"start": 649.0, "text": "setup such as login credentials"}, {"start": 652.0, "text": "populate the first row with an"}, {"start": 653.0, "text": "item informing the user of the"}, {"start": 654.0, "text": "app's current state onscreen."}, {"start": 657.0, "text": "That's it for enabling audio"}, {"start": 658.0, "text": "apps and I'll hand it off to"}, {"start": 659.0, "text": "Chris Whitney to discuss"}, {"start": 661.0, "text": "messaging and VoIP apps in"}, {"start": 662.0, "text": "CarPlay."}, {"start": 665.0, "text": "Hi, I'm Chris Whitney from"}, {"start": 666.0, "text": "the CarPlay engineering team."}, {"start": 668.0, "text": "Albert talked about audio apps"}, {"start": 670.0, "text": "now I will discuss a few more"}, {"start": 671.0, "text": "categories of apps that can"}, {"start": 673.0, "text": "integrate with CarPlay."}, {"start": 674.0, "text": "The first category I will cover"}, {"start": 676.0, "text": "is messaging and voice over"}, {"start": 678.0, "text": "Internet protocol calling apps."}, {"start": 682.0, "text": "In CarPlay Siri provides the"}, {"start": 683.0, "text": "interface for messaging and VoIP"}, {"start": 686.0, "text": "calling apps."}, {"start": 687.0, "text": "After the app icon is selected"}, {"start": 689.0, "text": "on the Home screen, Siri offers"}, {"start": 691.0, "text": "interactions for reading"}, {"start": 692.0, "text": "messages, starting a new message"}, {"start": 694.0, "text": "or starting an audio call."}, {"start": 697.0, "text": "Apps using SiriKit can already"}, {"start": 699.0, "text": "handle these actions, but the"}, {"start": 701.0, "text": "Siri request must contain the"}, {"start": 703.0, "text": "app's name."}, {"start": 705.0, "text": "With a few additional changes"}, {"start": 707.0, "text": "messaging and VoIP apps can have"}, {"start": 709.0, "text": "a CarPlay experience that"}, {"start": 710.0, "text": "includes a Home screen icon,"}, {"start": 712.0, "text": "notifications, and a dedicated"}, {"start": 714.0, "text": "Siri interface."}, {"start": 716.0, "text": "Here are the requirements for an"}, {"start": 720.0, "text": "app to support messaging or VoIP"}, {"start": 722.0, "text": "calling in CarPlay."}, {"start": 725.0, "text": "Messaging apps must implement"}, {"start": 727.0, "text": "SirKit messaging intents and"}, {"start": 729.0, "text": "sign their app with an"}, {"start": 730.0, "text": "entitlement that is specific to"}, {"start": 731.0, "text": "CarPlay messaging."}, {"start": 734.0, "text": "Similarly, VoIP calling apps"}, {"start": 737.0, "text": "must implement the SiriKit"}, {"start": 738.0, "text": "calling intents and sign their"}, {"start": 740.0, "text": "app with an entitlement that is"}, {"start": 742.0, "text": "specific to CarPlay VoIP"}, {"start": 743.0, "text": "calling."}, {"start": 745.0, "text": "VoIP calling apps must also"}, {"start": 747.0, "text": "implement CallKit to inform"}, {"start": 748.0, "text": "CarPlay about the status of"}, {"start": 750.0, "text": "calls."}, {"start": 751.0, "text": "A single app can support both"}, {"start": 754.0, "text": "messaging and VoIP calling in"}, {"start": 756.0, "text": "CarPlay."}, {"start": 758.0, "text": "Let's look into the SiriKit"}, {"start": 759.0, "text": "requirements in more detail."}, {"start": 763.0, "text": "For messaging apps, Siri sends"}, {"start": 766.0, "text": "messages using"}, {"start": 767.0, "text": "INSendMessageIntent."}, {"start": 770.0, "text": "Siri reads new incoming messages"}, {"start": 773.0, "text": "and searches for unread messages"}, {"start": 775.0, "text": "using INSearchforMessagesIntent."}, {"start": 778.0, "text": "And once done reading Siri marks"}, {"start": 780.0, "text": "messages as read by calling"}, {"start": 782.0, "text": "INSendMessageAttributeIntent."}, {"start": 785.0, "text": "All three intents are required"}, {"start": 787.0, "text": "to support a complete messaging"}, {"start": 789.0, "text": "workflow in CarPlay."}, {"start": 791.0, "text": "For VoIP calling apps, Siri"}, {"start": 795.0, "text": "starts audio calls using"}, {"start": 798.0, "text": "INStartAudiCallIntent and"}, {"start": 801.0, "text": "performs searches, such as for"}, {"start": 803.0, "text": "missed calls using"}, {"start": 805.0, "text": "INSearchCallHistoryIntent."}, {"start": 808.0, "text": "Both intents are required to"}, {"start": 810.0, "text": "support a complete calling"}, {"start": 811.0, "text": "workflow in CarPlay."}, {"start": 814.0, "text": "For details on SirKit see the"}, {"start": 816.0, "text": "session's What's New in SiriKit"}, {"start": 819.0, "text": "and Making Great SiriKit"}, {"start": 821.0, "text": "Experiences."}, {"start": 822.0, "text": "Any app that has already"}, {"start": 826.0, "text": "implemented CallKit gets a"}, {"start": 829.0, "text": "CarPlay interface for incoming"}, {"start": 830.0, "text": "and active calls."}, {"start": 832.0, "text": "But if your VoIP calling app"}, {"start": 834.0, "text": "hasn't implemented CallKit yet"}, {"start": 836.0, "text": "that will be a requirement for"}, {"start": 838.0, "text": "CarPlay integration."}, {"start": 840.0, "text": "As a general overview, the app"}, {"start": 842.0, "text": "must report incoming calls to"}, {"start": 844.0, "text": "CallKit and handle the start,"}, {"start": 847.0, "text": "answer and end call actions."}, {"start": 850.0, "text": "Additional actions, such as"}, {"start": 851.0, "text": "mute, grouping, holding and"}, {"start": 854.0, "text": "keypad tones should be handled"}, {"start": 856.0, "text": "if supported by the app's VoIP"}, {"start": 858.0, "text": "platform."}, {"start": 860.0, "text": "For more details on CallKit"}, {"start": 862.0, "text": "watch the enhancing VoIP apps"}, {"start": 864.0, "text": "with CallKit video from WWDC"}, {"start": 866.0, "text": "2016."}, {"start": 870.0, "text": "Apps can show notifications in"}, {"start": 872.0, "text": "CarPlay for incoming messages"}, {"start": 874.0, "text": "and missed calls."}, {"start": 876.0, "text": "There's some additional setup"}, {"start": 877.0, "text": "required to show notifications"}, {"start": 879.0, "text": "in CarPlay."}, {"start": 880.0, "text": "The CarPlay option must be"}, {"start": 882.0, "text": "included when requesting"}, {"start": 884.0, "text": "authorization for notifications"}, {"start": 886.0, "text": "and the messages must be"}, {"start": 888.0, "text": "separated into a notification"}, {"start": 890.0, "text": "category created with the Allow"}, {"start": 893.0, "text": "in CarPlay option."}, {"start": 895.0, "text": "This notifications category must"}, {"start": 898.0, "text": "be used exclusively for messages"}, {"start": 900.0, "text": "and it should not include"}, {"start": 901.0, "text": "notifications for other app"}, {"start": 903.0, "text": "features."}, {"start": 904.0, "text": "The notification category must"}, {"start": 908.0, "text": "specify a SiriKit intent to"}, {"start": 911.0, "text": "handle selection of the notification in CarPlay."}, {"start": 915.0, "text": "Only messaging or VoIP calling"}, {"start": 917.0, "text": "apps that meet the CarPlay"}, {"start": 918.0, "text": "requirements will be allowed to"}, {"start": 920.0, "text": "request authorization for"}, {"start": 921.0, "text": "showing notifications."}, {"start": 924.0, "text": "Also, users can use the Settings"}, {"start": 926.0, "text": "op to disable showing your app's"}, {"start": 928.0, "text": "notifications in CarPlay."}, {"start": 931.0, "text": "Let's look at the code for"}, {"start": 932.0, "text": "setting up notifications in"}, {"start": 933.0, "text": "CarPlay."}, {"start": 936.0, "text": "First, include the CarPlay"}, {"start": 938.0, "text": "option when requesting"}, {"start": 940.0, "text": "authorization for notifications."}, {"start": 942.0, "text": "Gracefully disable notifications"}, {"start": 945.0, "text": "related features if the user"}, {"start": 947.0, "text": "declines notification"}, {"start": 948.0, "text": "authorization."}, {"start": 950.0, "text": "Next, create a new message"}, {"start": 952.0, "text": "category that contains only"}, {"start": 954.0, "text": "notifications for messages."}, {"start": 956.0, "text": "Notifications for other app"}, {"start": 957.0, "text": "features, such as news or games"}, {"start": 960.0, "text": "should not be included in this"}, {"start": 962.0, "text": "notification category."}, {"start": 963.0, "text": "Assign an identifier to this"}, {"start": 966.0, "text": "category and make sure that any"}, {"start": 968.0, "text": "local or remote notifications"}, {"start": 970.0, "text": "for messages have the same"}, {"start": 972.0, "text": "category identifier."}, {"start": 974.0, "text": "Set up an intent identifier to"}, {"start": 977.0, "text": "configure the Siri interaction"}, {"start": 980.0, "text": "when the notification is"}, {"start": 981.0, "text": "selected in CarPlay."}, {"start": 983.0, "text": "Usually that will be"}, {"start": 984.0, "text": "INSearchForMessages"}, {"start": 985.0, "text": "IntentIdentifier which"}, {"start": 987.0, "text": "configures Siri to search for"}, {"start": 989.0, "text": "and then read the message that"}, {"start": 991.0, "text": "matches this notification."}, {"start": 993.0, "text": "There are a few best practices"}, {"start": 996.0, "text": "to follow when building"}, {"start": 997.0, "text": "messaging and VoIP calling apps."}, {"start": 1001.0, "text": "Notifications should only"}, {"start": 1002.0, "text": "include information like the"}, {"start": 1003.0, "text": "sender and group name in the"}, {"start": 1006.0, "text": "title and subtitle."}, {"start": 1007.0, "text": "The contents of a message should"}, {"start": 1009.0, "text": "not appear in CarPlay."}, {"start": 1011.0, "text": "After reading a message, Siri"}, {"start": 1014.0, "text": "will use"}, {"start": 1015.0, "text": "INSentMessageAttributeIntent to"}, {"start": 1017.0, "text": "mark content as read."}, {"start": 1019.0, "text": "The read status should be"}, {"start": 1020.0, "text": "reflected in the app and"}, {"start": 1022.0, "text": "subsequent search for messages"}, {"start": 1023.0, "text": "requests."}, {"start": 1025.0, "text": "Since users may drive in and out"}, {"start": 1028.0, "text": "of cellular coverage areas apps"}, {"start": 1030.0, "text": "should use notifications to"}, {"start": 1032.0, "text": "communicate any missed calls or"}, {"start": 1034.0, "text": "message delivery failures."}, {"start": 1037.0, "text": "This may require setting up"}, {"start": 1038.0, "text": "additional notification"}, {"start": 1039.0, "text": "categories as we have described"}, {"start": 1041.0, "text": "earlier."}, {"start": 1042.0, "text": "The final category of apps that"}, {"start": 1046.0, "text": "can integrate into CarPlay are"}, {"start": 1048.0, "text": "automaker apps."}, {"start": 1052.0, "text": "Automaker apps are the only"}, {"start": 1053.0, "text": "category of apps that can"}, {"start": 1055.0, "text": "display a custom user interface"}, {"start": 1056.0, "text": "in CarPlay."}, {"start": 1058.0, "text": "In this example, the automaker"}, {"start": 1059.0, "text": "app provides controls for"}, {"start": 1061.0, "text": "adjusting the climate settings,"}, {"start": 1063.0, "text": "selecting radio stations, and"}, {"start": 1065.0, "text": "summoning roadside assistance."}, {"start": 1067.0, "text": "Providing these controls in an"}, {"start": 1069.0, "text": "automaker app allows the user to"}, {"start": 1071.0, "text": "adjust the vehicle's climate and"}, {"start": 1073.0, "text": "radio without leaving CarPlay."}, {"start": 1075.0, "text": "Automaker apps can take"}, {"start": 1078.0, "text": "advantage of the iPhone's"}, {"start": 1079.0, "text": "Internet connectivity and"}, {"start": 1080.0, "text": "powerful development platform to"}, {"start": 1082.0, "text": "create additional vehicle"}, {"start": 1084.0, "text": "features."}, {"start": 1085.0, "text": "For example, this automaker app"}, {"start": 1087.0, "text": "could enable Siri driven voice"}, {"start": 1089.0, "text": "control of the climate and radio"}, {"start": 1091.0, "text": "settings."}, {"start": 1095.0, "text": "Automaker apps must be created"}, {"start": 1097.0, "text": "by the car's manufacturer to"}, {"start": 1098.0, "text": "provide information and control"}, {"start": 1100.0, "text": "features on a connected vehicle."}, {"start": 1102.0, "text": "These apps must be signed with a"}, {"start": 1105.0, "text": "specific CarPlay protocols"}, {"start": 1107.0, "text": "entitlement."}, {"start": 1108.0, "text": "They must display a user"}, {"start": 1110.0, "text": "interface in CarPlay."}, {"start": 1112.0, "text": "And they must only appear on"}, {"start": 1115.0, "text": "supported vehicles."}, {"start": 1119.0, "text": "CarPlay determines if an"}, {"start": 1120.0, "text": "automaker app is supported on a"}, {"start": 1122.0, "text": "given vehicle by matching the"}, {"start": 1124.0, "text": "external accessory protocols"}, {"start": 1126.0, "text": "declared by the vehicle with the"}, {"start": 1128.0, "text": "CarPlay protocols entitlement"}, {"start": 1130.0, "text": "sign in to the app."}, {"start": 1133.0, "text": "Thus, it is important to consider potential automaker"}, {"start": 1135.0, "text": "apps during vehicle development"}, {"start": 1138.0, "text": "in order to have the appropriate"}, {"start": 1139.0, "text": "set of protocols declared by the"}, {"start": 1141.0, "text": "vehicle."}, {"start": 1142.0, "text": "Here's an example of how CarPlay"}, {"start": 1145.0, "text": "matches automaker apps to"}, {"start": 1147.0, "text": "vehicles."}, {"start": 1148.0, "text": "This vehicle declares two"}, {"start": 1150.0, "text": "protocols, a performance"}, {"start": 1152.0, "text": "protocol for collecting vehicle"}, {"start": 1154.0, "text": "statistics and a protocol for"}, {"start": 1156.0, "text": "climate control."}, {"start": 1158.0, "text": "As shown here, protocol names"}, {"start": 1160.0, "text": "should be declared in reverse"}, {"start": 1161.0, "text": "DNS format."}, {"start": 1163.0, "text": "The automaker wants to take"}, {"start": 1167.0, "text": "advantage of the vehicle's"}, {"start": 1168.0, "text": "performance statistics in a new"}, {"start": 1170.0, "text": "app called Track Laps that's"}, {"start": 1173.0, "text": "designed for use on racetracks."}, {"start": 1175.0, "text": "The app includes the performance"}, {"start": 1176.0, "text": "protocol and its entitlements"}, {"start": 1178.0, "text": "and since both the app and the"}, {"start": 1181.0, "text": "vehicle support the performance"}, {"start": 1183.0, "text": "protocol the Track Laps app will"}, {"start": 1187.0, "text": "appear in CarPlay."}, {"start": 1191.0, "text": "Automaker apps can also support"}, {"start": 1193.0, "text": "multiple protocols."}, {"start": 1196.0, "text": "This automaker decides to follow"}, {"start": 1197.0, "text": "up on the success of Track Laps"}, {"start": 1199.0, "text": "with a new app called Comfort"}, {"start": 1202.0, "text": "Cruise that conveniently"}, {"start": 1203.0, "text": "configures the radio and climate"}, {"start": 1205.0, "text": "control with the driver's"}, {"start": 1207.0, "text": "favorite settings for commuting."}, {"start": 1209.0, "text": "The app's entitlements include"}, {"start": 1210.0, "text": "both the climate protocol and a"}, {"start": 1213.0, "text": "new radio protocol."}, {"start": 1214.0, "text": "This vehicle doesn't support the"}, {"start": 1217.0, "text": "radio protocol, but since both"}, {"start": 1219.0, "text": "the app and the vehicle support"}, {"start": 1221.0, "text": "the climate protocol the Comfort"}, {"start": 1224.0, "text": "Cruise app will appear in"}, {"start": 1225.0, "text": "CarPlay."}, {"start": 1227.0, "text": "After launching automaker apps"}, {"start": 1229.0, "text": "should query the supported"}, {"start": 1230.0, "text": "external accessory protocols and"}, {"start": 1232.0, "text": "only display a user interface"}, {"start": 1235.0, "text": "for the supported features."}, {"start": 1237.0, "text": "In this example, the Comfort"}, {"start": 1239.0, "text": "Cruise app should only show"}, {"start": 1240.0, "text": "climate controls since the radio"}, {"start": 1242.0, "text": "protocol is not supported on"}, {"start": 1244.0, "text": "this vehicle."}, {"start": 1249.0, "text": "The automaker wants to create"}, {"start": 1250.0, "text": "another app called Charge Up"}, {"start": 1253.0, "text": "that shows their electric"}, {"start": 1254.0, "text": "vehicle charging stations."}, {"start": 1256.0, "text": "To limit this app to only their"}, {"start": 1258.0, "text": "electric vehicles the automaker"}, {"start": 1259.0, "text": "declares a new electric protocol"}, {"start": 1262.0, "text": "in the app's entitlements."}, {"start": 1264.0, "text": "Since this vehicle does not"}, {"start": 1267.0, "text": "support the electric protocol"}, {"start": 1269.0, "text": "the Charge Up app will not"}, {"start": 1270.0, "text": "appear in CarPlay on this"}, {"start": 1273.0, "text": "vehicle."}, {"start": 1276.0, "text": "Building an automaker app"}, {"start": 1277.0, "text": "requires communicating with the"}, {"start": 1278.0, "text": "vehicle."}, {"start": 1280.0, "text": "Automaker apps must communicate"}, {"start": 1282.0, "text": "directly from the iPhone to the"}, {"start": 1284.0, "text": "vehicle using the External"}, {"start": 1285.0, "text": "Accessory framework."}, {"start": 1287.0, "text": "Directly communicating using"}, {"start": 1289.0, "text": "External Accessory improves the"}, {"start": 1291.0, "text": "responsiveness of the app and"}, {"start": 1293.0, "text": "avoids relying on connectivity"}, {"start": 1295.0, "text": "to Internet services."}, {"start": 1297.0, "text": "To use the External Accessory"}, {"start": 1298.0, "text": "framework the app should define"}, {"start": 1301.0, "text": "a custom protocol name as shown"}, {"start": 1303.0, "text": "previously, implement the named"}, {"start": 1305.0, "text": "protocol in the vehicle"}, {"start": 1306.0, "text": "software, in the app observe"}, {"start": 1310.0, "text": "accessory connection events, and"}, {"start": 1313.0, "text": "upon connection initialize an EA"}, {"start": 1315.0, "text": "session to create networking"}, {"start": 1316.0, "text": "streams of the vehicle."}, {"start": 1318.0, "text": "For more information see"}, {"start": 1321.0, "text": "External Accessory programming"}, {"start": 1323.0, "text": "topics."}, {"start": 1325.0, "text": "Automaker apps can use UIKit to"}, {"start": 1328.0, "text": "display a user interface on the"}, {"start": 1329.0, "text": "CarPlay screen."}, {"start": 1331.0, "text": "To create an interface in"}, {"start": 1332.0, "text": "CarPlay the app should observe"}, {"start": 1335.0, "text": "the UIScreen connection events"}, {"start": 1338.0, "text": "and when the screen connects"}, {"start": 1339.0, "text": "verify that the connected"}, {"start": 1340.0, "text": "screen's traits contain the"}, {"start": 1342.0, "text": "CarPlay idiom."}, {"start": 1344.0, "text": "Besides CarPlay, iOS also"}, {"start": 1346.0, "text": "supports other external"}, {"start": 1347.0, "text": "displays, such as an airplane"}, {"start": 1349.0, "text": "display."}, {"start": 1350.0, "text": "Only show CarPlay content on"}, {"start": 1352.0, "text": "screens with the CarPlay idiom."}, {"start": 1354.0, "text": "The app creates a UIWindow for"}, {"start": 1359.0, "text": "the CarPlay screen and sets the"}, {"start": 1361.0, "text": "root view controller to a custom"}, {"start": 1363.0, "text": "UI view controller subclass."}, {"start": 1366.0, "text": "Let's see how this looks when"}, {"start": 1367.0, "text": "all put together."}, {"start": 1371.0, "text": "Here's the code for displaying a"}, {"start": 1373.0, "text": "view controller on the CarPlay"}, {"start": 1374.0, "text": "screen."}, {"start": 1375.0, "text": "Usually this code would be"}, {"start": 1376.0, "text": "placed either in your UI"}, {"start": 1378.0, "text": "application delegate or in a new"}, {"start": 1381.0, "text": "class you've made for this code."}, {"start": 1383.0, "text": "First, we'll add a new class"}, {"start": 1385.0, "text": "property to store the UIWindow"}, {"start": 1387.0, "text": "that we will create for the"}, {"start": 1388.0, "text": "CarPlay screen."}, {"start": 1390.0, "text": "Next, we'll define an instance"}, {"start": 1392.0, "text": "method called updateCarWindow."}, {"start": 1395.0, "text": "To check if a CarPlay screen is"}, {"start": 1396.0, "text": "connected we look for a UIScreen"}, {"start": 1398.0, "text": "that has the CarPlay idiom."}, {"start": 1401.0, "text": "If no CarPlay idiom screens are"}, {"start": 1402.0, "text": "available then release any"}, {"start": 1404.0, "text": "previously created UIWindow"}, {"start": 1406.0, "text": "since CarPlay may have"}, {"start": 1408.0, "text": "disconnected."}, {"start": 1409.0, "text": "If a CarPlay screen is connected"}, {"start": 1413.0, "text": "initialize a new UIWindow for"}, {"start": 1415.0, "text": "that screen and set up a custom"}, {"start": 1417.0, "text": "rootViewController that contains"}, {"start": 1419.0, "text": "the content that should appear"}, {"start": 1420.0, "text": "in CarPlay."}, {"start": 1422.0, "text": "Here we are using a UI view"}, {"start": 1423.0, "text": "controller subclass called"}, {"start": 1425.0, "text": "carViewController."}, {"start": 1427.0, "text": "That class will need to be"}, {"start": 1428.0, "text": "implemented."}, {"start": 1429.0, "text": "Your app may launch after"}, {"start": 1433.0, "text": "CarPlay connected."}, {"start": 1435.0, "text": "To handle that scenario call"}, {"start": 1437.0, "text": "updateCarWindow early in your"}, {"start": 1438.0, "text": "application's lifecycle, such as"}, {"start": 1440.0, "text": "an application did finish"}, {"start": 1442.0, "text": "launching with options."}, {"start": 1444.0, "text": "Since CarPlay can also connect"}, {"start": 1445.0, "text": "after your app is launched"}, {"start": 1447.0, "text": "listen for the"}, {"start": 1448.0, "text": "UIScreenDidConnect and"}, {"start": 1450.0, "text": "UIScreenDidDisconnect"}, {"start": 1452.0, "text": "notifications and call"}, {"start": 1454.0, "text": "UpdateCarWindow in response to"}, {"start": 1455.0, "text": "those events."}, {"start": 1458.0, "text": "There are a few differences in"}, {"start": 1459.0, "text": "UIKit behavior on the CarPlay"}, {"start": 1461.0, "text": "screen compared to the iPhone's"}, {"start": 1464.0, "text": "main screen."}, {"start": 1465.0, "text": "UIButtonTypeSystem displays with"}, {"start": 1467.0, "text": "the default CarPlay style and is"}, {"start": 1469.0, "text": "the recommended way to create"}, {"start": 1470.0, "text": "buttons since it provides a"}, {"start": 1472.0, "text": "style and behavior consistent"}, {"start": 1474.0, "text": "with other CarPlay apps."}, {"start": 1478.0, "text": "In CarPlay, UITableViewController may limit"}, {"start": 1481.0, "text": "the length of tables and for"}, {"start": 1484.0, "text": "vehicles with a hardware"}, {"start": 1485.0, "text": "navigation device, such as the"}, {"start": 1488.0, "text": ", the corresponding focus movements are handled"}, {"start": 1490.0, "text": "through UIFocusEnvironment and"}, {"start": 1492.0, "text": "the related focus classes."}, {"start": 1494.0, "text": "Note that not all system user"}, {"start": 1497.0, "text": "interface elements provided by"}, {"start": 1499.0, "text": "UIKit are available to automaker"}, {"start": 1502.0, "text": "apps."}, {"start": 1505.0, "text": "There's a selection of SiriKit"}, {"start": 1506.0, "text": "intents relevant to automaker"}, {"start": 1507.0, "text": "apps."}, {"start": 1509.0, "text": "The commands intents are"}, {"start": 1510.0, "text": "available to all apps."}, {"start": 1512.0, "text": "They don't require a CarPlay"}, {"start": 1513.0, "text": "connection nor participating in"}, {"start": 1515.0, "text": "the CarPlay app program."}, {"start": 1517.0, "text": "But an automaker app is a great"}, {"start": 1518.0, "text": "place to implement these"}, {"start": 1519.0, "text": "intents, which include locking"}, {"start": 1522.0, "text": "the vehicle, checking the fuel"}, {"start": 1523.0, "text": "level and sounding the horn."}, {"start": 1526.0, "text": "There's also a set of intents"}, {"start": 1528.0, "text": "that require a CarPlay"}, {"start": 1529.0, "text": "connection and can only be"}, {"start": 1530.0, "text": "implemented by automaker apps."}, {"start": 1533.0, "text": "The CarPlay intents include"}, {"start": 1535.0, "text": "climate control, defroster and"}, {"start": 1537.0, "text": "seat heater settings."}, {"start": 1539.0, "text": "Also included are intents for"}, {"start": 1541.0, "text": "tuning the radio and selecting"}, {"start": 1542.0, "text": "an audio source."}, {"start": 1544.0, "text": "There are a few best practices"}, {"start": 1547.0, "text": "for automaker apps."}, {"start": 1549.0, "text": "The first is to make your app"}, {"start": 1550.0, "text": "useful even when CarPlay is not"}, {"start": 1552.0, "text": "available."}, {"start": 1553.0, "text": "For example, when disconnected"}, {"start": 1555.0, "text": "from CarPlay an automaker app"}, {"start": 1557.0, "text": "can use Internet services to"}, {"start": 1558.0, "text": "remotely communicate with the"}, {"start": 1562.0, "text": "vehicle. Consider backwards and forwards"}, {"start": 1564.0, "text": "compatibility in your automaker"}, {"start": 1567.0, "text": "app. App updates should continue to"}, {"start": 1569.0, "text": "support older vehicles and new"}, {"start": 1571.0, "text": "features should not break"}, {"start": 1572.0, "text": "existing versions of the app."}, {"start": 1577.0, "text": "Simplify the user interface,"}, {"start": 1579.0, "text": "most CarPlay apps should only"}, {"start": 1581.0, "text": "contain fundamental interface"}, {"start": 1582.0, "text": "elements, such as buttons,"}, {"start": 1585.0, "text": "labels, tables, navigation bars"}, {"start": 1589.0, "text": "and tabs."}, {"start": 1592.0, "text": "Finally, if your automaker app"}, {"start": 1593.0, "text": "supports vehicles with a"}, {"start": 1594.0, "text": "hardware navigation device such"}, {"start": 1597.0, "text": "as a  determine how"}, {"start": 1598.0, "text": "focus should move between the UI"}, {"start": 1600.0, "text": "elements."}, {"start": 1604.0, "text": "We hope that you've learned how"}, {"start": 1605.0, "text": "to integrate an audio,"}, {"start": 1607.0, "text": "messaging, VoIP calling or"}, {"start": 1609.0, "text": "automaker app into CarPlay."}, {"start": 1611.0, "text": "For more information about"}, {"start": 1612.0, "text": "CarPlay, see"}, {"start": 1613.0, "text": "developer.apple.com."}, {"start": 1616.0, "text": "You can also learn more in"}, {"start": 1617.0, "text": "related sessions."}, {"start": 1619.0, "text": "See the Debugging with Xcode 9"}, {"start": 1620.0, "text": "session for more information"}, {"start": 1622.0, "text": "about debugging apps during a"}, {"start": 1624.0, "text": "wired CarPlay connection."}, {"start": 1626.0, "text": "For more information about"}, {"start": 1627.0, "text": "SiriKit, see the sessions What's"}, {"start": 1629.0, "text": "New in SiriKit and Making Great"}, {"start": 1631.0, "text": "SiriKit Experiences."}, {"start": 1634.0, "text": "To learn how wireless CarPlay"}, {"start": 1635.0, "text": "works watch the Developing"}, {"start": 1636.0, "text": "Wireless CarPlay Systems video."}, {"start": 1639.0, "text": "Videos from WWDC 2016 are"}, {"start": 1642.0, "text": "available for both CallKit and"}, {"start": 1644.0, "text": "CarPlay systems development"}]}